<title>USA: Covol Tech names Brent Cook president.</title>
<headline>Covol Tech names Brent Cook president.</headline>
<dateline>LEHI, Utah 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Covol Technologies Inc said on Monday that Brent Cook, formerly Covol's chief financial officer, was named president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Ken Young, chief executive officer and chairman and Mike Midgley, president, are leaving the company to pursue other interests, Covol said.</p>
<p>Russ Madsen will serve as the interim chairman of the board until a shareholder vote can be held, the company said.</p>
</text>
